@title EPISODE 06 • CASSIE KNOWS
@bg locker_room
@show cassie
Cassie: London. Quick question. Totally random.
London: Nothing you've ever said has been random.
Cassie: What would you do for, hypothetically, somebody to NOT say something about Suki and a certain sprinter?
> [Bitchy] "Say one word and I'll end you, Cassie." -> x_bitchy
> [Bold] "What do you want?" -> x_bold
> [Good] "Go tell Coach. Then explain how you know." -> x_good
> [Sweet] "Cass. Why would you do this to her?" -> x_sweet
*x_bitchy
@add Team_Reputation -2
@add Cassie_Threat 2
Cassie: Ooh. Scary. Love that for you. Clock's ticking, though.
@jump x_done
*x_bold
@add Cassie_Threat 1
Cassie: Relay spot. Suki's 4x400 leg. She "pulls a hamstring," I run instead. Easy.
@jump x_done
*x_good
@add Cassie_Threat -2
@add Coach_Respect 1
Cassie's smile twitches. Listening at doors doesn't look great in front of Holloway either.
@jump x_done
*x_sweet
@add Cassie_Threat -1
Cassie: (finally, quiet) Because nobody ever picks me for anything. Not the relay. Not anybody.
That's real. London hates that it's real.
*x_done
@hide
@if Secret_Kept 1 kept
@bg penthouse_night
@show paris
Paris: Jayden's been weird all week. Like guilty-weird. You'd tell me if you knew something, right?
London looks at her twin — same face, softer heart — and says nothing. Not yet.
@jump end
*kept
@bg penthouse_night
@show paris
Paris: You've been weird all week. You and Suki both. What's going on?
London: Nothing. Midterms.
Paris: You don't stress about midterms. You stress about people.
*end
@load s1/ep07.mvs
